id: pm-graph-vgj0
title: Cover the output_format decline contract with real SDK harness tests instead of a registration-only assertion
description: "The existing export-and-contract test asserted only that registerService was called for output_format, using a hand-rolled api double with an as any cast. That can never observe the override's RETURN value, which is exactly what regressed under pm-cli 2026.7.27: an override's bare return IS what the host renders, so the previous decline path returning ctx.payload made every command print the whole command context. Added two cases through createExtensionTestHarness plus runRegisteredServiceOverrideForTest: an unrelated command payload must be declined with handled false, the payload returned untouched and no service-override warnings, and a pm-graph export raw-output payload must still be claimed verbatim. Suite is 97 pass 0 fail. Filed upstream as unbraind/pm-cli#776."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-27T15:23:59.903Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T10:56:41.373Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:13:36.072Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:13:36.072Z"
author: claude-code
resolution: "Reverified main f46704ef4083: PR #39 (a5b50ab) delivered the output_format decline implementation and real SDK service-runner regressions. PR #140 (ef2caae) verified the existing tests with a behavioral revert; it did not change test/export-and-contract.test.ts. Retained evidence: src/index.ts, test/export-and-contract.test.ts."
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T06:32:57.654Z",codex-agent,"Already implemented on current main: test/export-and-contract.test.ts:348 and :365 use makeHarness (createExtensionTestHarness with a real tracker) and runRegisteredServiceOverrideForTest. They assert handled=false, unchanged unrelated payload and no warnings, plus handled=true/verbatim raw output. src/index.ts:2805 explicitly returns { handled: false }. Will run the actual tests and revert only that return expression to ctx.payload to prove the decline regression is detected."
  "2026-10-16T06:41:52.056Z",codex-agent,"Verified existing implementation from a5b50ab (#39), contained by v2026.07.28: the real SDK tests pass 2/2, no skips. Behavioral revert in an isolated copy changed only src/index.ts decline return from { handled: false } to ctx.payload: decline test failed on extension_output_format_payload_echo_deprecated while the raw-output test still passed (1 pass/1 fail). Restored implementation passes. No registration-only assertion is used as the proof."
